{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]I'm gonna wrap [F]myself in [G]paper
[C]Im gonna daub [F]myself with [G]glue
[Am]Stick some stamps on the [F]top of my head
[G]I'm gonna mail myself to [C]you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]I'm gonna tie [F]me up red [G]string
[C]I'm gonna tie [F]blue ribbons [G]too
[Am]I'm gonna climb up in [F]my mailbox
[G]I'm gonna mail myself to [C]you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
When you find me in your mailbox
Cut the string and let me out
Wash the glue off of my fingers
Stick some bubble gum in my mouth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
I'm gonna wrap myself in paper
